                "if": {
                  "flagIs": [
                    "termination_status",
                    "acknowledged"
                  ]
                },
                "text": "The restroom is only a few steps farther. You touch your badge to the reader. The light turns red: EMPLOYEE ACCESS REQUIRED.\n\nYou have proof of dismissal in your pocket. It offers no help with the lock."
