                "text": "The next counter is marked PROPERTY FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE. A clerk examines your empty hands, then a blank inventory card.\n\n\"No loose personal effects,\" the clerk says, marking the card. \"Official correspondence is exempt.\"\n\nYou glance at the doors beyond the desk. Somewhere inside, there must be a bathroom."
